1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,250
Baru mau fokus belajar,

2
00:00:01,700 --> 00:00:02,850
eh, cegukan.

3
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:05,550
Kenapa bunyinya bisa ‘hik’?

4
00:00:06,550 --> 00:00:07,720
Di bawah paru-paru,

5
00:00:07,780 --> 00:00:09,500
ada otot bernama diafragma.

6
00:00:10,020 --> 00:00:10,850
Saat cegukan,

7
00:00:11,120 --> 00:00:12,900
