11
00:00:17,740 --> 00:00:18,740
Penutupan itulah

12
00:00:18,740 --> 00:00:20,250
yang menghasilkan bunyi ‘hik’.

13
00:00:21,040 --> 00:00:22,120
Makan terlalu cepat

14
00:00:22,120 --> 00:00:23,300
atau perut yang terlalu penuh

15
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:24,650
bisa memicu cegukan.

16
00:00:24,980 --> 00:00:25,900
Tapi kadang,

17
00:00:25,960 --> 00:00:26,800
cegukan muncul

18
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:27,750
tanpa penyebab yang jelas.

19
00:00:30,700 --> 00:00:34,600
Di MEDCOEL, jelajahi Atlas 3D dan Live 4D Lab.

20
00:00:34,820 --> 00:00:38,620
